{
    "test_name": "MOB.806_Search_MultiValue",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.806_Search_MultiValue",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.806` **The MULTI-VALUE branch of `StructuredQuery`'s value input.**\n- `renderValueInput` has two branches; `MOB.800`/`MOB.805` only ever drive the\n  single-value one. Picking operator **`includes`** replaces the value input with\n  `MultiValueSelector` \u2014 untested until now.\n- Drives the **string** case, which renders a `TagsInput` and needs no option loading, so\n  it tests the branch rather than the network. (`enum` \u2192 MultiSelect and `record` \u2192\n  async `RecordMultiSelect` are the other two forks.)\n- \u2b50 **The real subject is the validation rule**, which nothing else in mobile has:\n  multi-value operators require a **non-empty array**, so `Add Filter` is inert with no\n  tags and live with one. Asserted around a real state change.\n  \u26a0\ufe0f **Not a repeat of `MOB.356`** \u2014 that covers the four work-collection forms, which\n  share one component and one `isValid`. This is a different form and a different rule.\n- \u2b50 **Proves a SWAP, not an addition**: the `TagsInput` appears **and** the single-value\n  `#value` input is gone. The first assertion alone would pass on a component that\n  rendered both.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **READ-ONLY and it never submits.** The filter is never added, so `filters` is\n  untouched and there is nothing to clear; a closing check confirms the trigger still\n  reads `Filters (0)`.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Search",
            "StructuredQuery",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
